<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>title</key><string>全屏OCR</string>
    <key>items</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>基本设置</string>
            <key>footerText</key><string>关闭后深链接会按原样交给系统处理，插件不做任何拦截。</string>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSSwitchCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>启用插件</string>
            <key>key</key><string>enabled</string>
            <key>defaults</key><string>com.axs.screenocr</string>
            <key>default</key><false/>
        </dict>
        <dict>
            <key>cell</key><string>PSGroupCell</string>
            <key>label</key><string>触发方式</string>
            <key>footerText</key><string>在 GesturePro 等工具的「预设链接」动作里填写 prefs:root=axsocr_recognize。下面的「测试触发」走独立的通知通道，不依赖深链接，用来验证插件本体是否正常。</string>
        </dict>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
